    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Private BUY: spend COL notes \\xe2\\x86\\x92 mint a 1:1 complete set \\xe2\\x86\\x92 swap the minted\\nopposite side on the YES\\xe2\\x86\\x94NO AMM \\xe2\\x86\\x92 receive (mintAmount + swapOut) of the\\ntarget outcome. The 1:1 mint avoids the pure-swap \"dust\" of a thin pool.\\nProof verified against CID_MINT_SWAP (mint_swap.circom).\\n\\n`payloads` carries two encrypted note payloads \\xe2\\x80\\x94 `[0]` for the output\\nnote, `[1]` for the COL change \\xe2\\x80\\x94 in the same order the commitments are\\ninserted into the tree.",
